1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,940
This is my wedding ring.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,339
It doesn't fit anymore,

3
00:00:03,339 --> 00:00:04,740
so it lives here.

4
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:05,879
Twenty nineteen,

5
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:07,339
my knuckles got big.

6
00:00:07,339 --> 00:00:08,660
The ring didn't get smaller.

7
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:11,140
I got bigger.

8
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,759
Angie laughed so hard.

9
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:13,419
She said, "Louie,

10
00:00:13,419 --> 00:00:14,140
now it's closer

11
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,039
to your heart like a,

12
00:00:15,919 --> 00:00:17,679
like a sheriff's badge."

13
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:19,480
She passed two years later.

14
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,000
Sixty-five years.

15
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,280
People ask me the secret.

16
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,179
We said good

17
00:00:24,179 --> 00:00:25,539
night every night,

18
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:27,000
even when we were fighting,

19
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,339
even through the bathroom door.

